  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      504.07,
      231.0,
      520.87
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      522.32,
      294.05,
      624.56
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called \u201c Woodthoop Watta\u201d in total extent of about 0.0506 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Maha 6536, dated on 01.04.2016, surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Aluthgama Mahakumbura Gammedda in Pallegampaha Korale Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pathadumbara in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      625.27,
      286.69,
      677.64
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1 \u2014 Name of the Land: Woodthoop Watta; Names and Address of the Claimants: 1. Mr. D. G. Pelis, No. 1/92, Aluthgama, Jambugahapitiya; Extent of the Land: 0.0506 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.63,
      539.4,
      395.84
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries: North: Lot No. 127 in PP A 1742; East: Lot No. 127 and 107 in PP A 1742; South: Lot No. 127 in PP A 1742; West: Lot No. 127 in PP A 1742.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      397.98,
      539.38,
      540.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, at Pathadumbara on the 20th day of July, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in Duplicate) on or before the 13th day of July, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
